// Apple macOS "Russian - QWERTY" (com.apple.keylayout.Russian-Phonetic) for
// Windows. Mac Option = AltGr (Right Alt). Caps Lock behaves as on the Mac:
// it selects the whole Shift layer, also together with Shift (SGCap rows).
// Source data and decisions: docs/sources.md. Build with build.ps1 (all
// architectures) or open in Microsoft Keyboard Layout Creator 1.4.

SHIFTSTATE

0	//Column 4
1	//Column 5 : Shft
2	//Column 6 :       Ctrl
3	//Column 7 : Shft  Ctrl
6	//Column 8 :       Ctrl Alt
7	//Column 9 : Shft  Ctrl Alt

